        <li>Battery Council International (BCI) — group size definitions and dimensional data.</li>
        <li>SAE J537 — cranking-ampere test method for the quoted CCA figures.</li>
        <li>Manufacturer datasheets (flooded / AGM / dual-purpose, both groups) — rating and dimension cross-checks.</li>
      </ul>

